title NovaStorm Skill Evolution Flow

actor "Pipeline / Callback" as User
participant "Individual Agent" as Agent
participant "Skill Council" as Council
participant "Memory Bank" as DB

note right of Agent
  Flat architecture:
  research_agent,
  ad_creative_agent,
  focus_group_evaluator_agent
end note

User -> Agent: After Pipeline Stage Complete
Agent -> Agent: Self-Reflection (after_agent_skill_reflection)
Agent -> Agent: Score (Actionability, Novelty, Specificity)
Agent -> DB: Save Skill DNA (if score > 6.0)

User -> Council: After SAVE_REPORT Stage
Council -> Council: Cross-Skill Discussion
Council -> Council: Generate Improvement Suggestions
Council -> DB: Save Skill Council Insights

DB -> Agent: Load Evolved Instructions (next run)
Agent --> User: Execute with Evolved Skills

